        "settings": {
          "hero_eyebrow": "The backstory",
          "hero_heading": "No acts. Just statements",
          "hero_subtext": "CAPSLOCK makes statement pieces built for the front row, the pit, and the long walk back to the campsite.",
          "story_heading": "Our story",
          "story_body": "<p><strong>How it started</strong></p><p>A couple of friends, a running joke, and CAPSLOCK was born. No acts, no smoke & mirrors — just statements. It began with our signature No Smoking Area cap, the kind of thing you make for yourself and your mates and don't expect anyone else to want. Turns out plenty of people did.</p><p><strong>How it's going</strong></p><p>So we kept building. One cap became a handful, the handful became a collection, and the running joke turned into a proper thing. Every design still starts the same way it always has: with a line that makes us laugh, worn loud enough to read across a crowded field.</p><p><strong>What we're about</strong></p><p>No hype drops. No gimmicks. No artificial \"only 50 ever made\" nonsense. Just heavyweight, well-made caps built to survive a full weekend of sets, back-to-back festivals, and every questionable decision in between — designed in the Netherlands, made for the mainstage.</p>",
          "mission_eyebrow": "Our mission",
          "mission_heading": "Built loud. Built to last.",
          "mission_body": "We make our caps properly. Every CAPSLOCK cap is cut from heavyweight cotton twill, stitched to survive a crowd surf and a thunderstorm, and finished with an embroidered patch that won't peel after one wash. No seasonal filler, no fast-fashion caps — just designs you'll actually reach for, festival after festival.",
          "cta_heading": "Tell them in all caps!",
          "cta_body": "Shop the cap that started it all, plus every design that's followed since.",
          "cta_label": "Shop all caps",
          "cta_link": "shopify://collections/all"
        }
      },
