              "body": "<p>CAPSLOCK is operated by Capslock, registered in the Netherlands under Chamber of Commerce (KvK) number 87371219 and VAT number NL004406764B72. Our registered address is Weidehoek 10, 3791 RP Achterveld, Netherlands. You can reach us at hello@capslock.com.</p>"
