              "body": "<p>\"We\", \"us\", \"CAPSLOCK\" — the seller described in Section 1. \"You\", \"customer\" — the person placing an order through our webshop. \"Products\" — the caps and related items offered for sale on capslock.com. \"Agreement\" — the contract of sale formed between you and us when an order is confirmed.</p>"
