              "body": "<p>These terms apply to every offer we make and every agreement formed between CAPSLOCK and a customer, unless we've agreed otherwise with you in writing. By placing an order, you accept these terms in full.</p>"
            }
          },
          "terms-main-3": {
            "type": "legal_section",
            "settings": {
              "title": "Orders & agreement",
              "body": "<p>An agreement is formed once we confirm your order by email. We reserve the right to refuse or cancel an order — for example in cases of suspected fraud, an out-of-stock product, or a pricing error — in which case we'll notify you and refund any payment already made.</p>"
