            "type": "legal_section",
            "settings": {
              "title": "Prices & payment",
              "body": "<p>All prices shown on capslock.com are in euros and include Dutch VAT. Shipping costs are shown separately at checkout. Payment is due at the time of ordering — we accept iDEAL, Bancontact, credit card, and Shop Pay.</p>"
            }
          },
          "terms-main-5": {
            "type": "legal_section",
            "settings": {
              "title": "Delivery",
              "body": "<p>We currently deliver to the Netherlands and Belgium. Standard orders arrive within 5 business days; Express orders placed before 15:00 arrive the next business day. Delivery times are estimates, not guarantees.</p>"
            }
          },
          "terms-main-6": {
            "type": "legal_section",
            "settings": {
              "title": "Right of withdrawal",
              "body": "<p>As an EU consumer, you have a statutory right to cancel your order within 14 days of receiving it, without giving a reason. Products must be returned unworn, unwashed, and in their original packaging. Return shipping costs are the customer's responsibility, except where the item is faulty, damaged, or incorrect.</p>"
            }
          },
          "terms-main-7": {
            "type": "legal_section",
            "settings": {
              "title": "Conformity & warranty",
              "body": "<p>We guarantee that our products conform to your order under Dutch and EU consumer law. If a product turns out to be defective, you're entitled to a repair, replacement, price reduction, or refund, as set out in the statutory conformity guarantee.</p>"
            }
          },
