            "type": "legal_section",
            "settings": {
              "title": "Liability",
              "body": "<p>Our liability for any damages arising from an agreement with you is limited to the amount you paid for the relevant order, except in cases of intent or gross negligence, or where liability cannot be limited under Dutch law.</p>"
